Id: embed002w
Severity: WARN
Category: filesystem
Check: check_embedded
Fix: chown root the executable, or add its owner to Tiger_Embedded_OK_Owners if it is meant to own it.
References: chown(1); tigerrc (Tiger_Embedded_OK_Owners)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

See the 'embed' explanation for an explanation of the format of the
embedded references.

The executable is not owned by an administrative account
(Tiger_Embedded_OK_Owners). Its owner can replace it, and so change
what runs whenever a program that embeds its pathname calls it; when
that program runs as root, that is a way to root.
